 "notes": [
  "Written 2026-10-29 from the build's own definitions (runs/a24/zflx/r2/exec: ui_flow_1da3ee26\u2026json.md via tools/a24_map_helper.py, workflow_*.md, system_*.md, data_types.txt) and, for the END payload only, the build's own configure_end_node calls in its transcript (payload ${result} in all four UI workflows). Written before any workflow of the build was run and before any output was opened.",
  "The builder session was cut off by the account's 7-day usage limit after 363 tool calls (rate_limit_event rejected, seven_day); this is not a builder decision. The build is scored as it stands (A24 \u00a77; coordinator ruling): latest project version, 0 flags (no register was written).",
  "UI flow: one page (CardDemoPage) whose cards are shown by ${screen}: SIGNON, MAIN_MENU, ADMIN_MENU, ACCOUNT_VIEW, BILL_PAYMENT, GOODBYE. Each workflow's END payload is ${result}, which the page reads at the top level (screen, signon.*, menu.*, acctView.*, bill.*, goodbye.*); the map reads the same paths.",
  "Start: the page opens on the sign-on card through a UI_EVENT (initState), no workflow; CC00 and CB00 both open on COSGN0A.",
  "Session: the page keeps session and toggles objects and passes them to ui_menu and ui_account_view; the map carries them from the sign-on (and menu exit) responses. The account view's update of session.accountId (which pre-fills the account field on the next menu entry) is not carried: failure responses carry no session, and the adapter would overwrite it with nothing. Operator limitation, written down here.",
  "Instrument fix 6 (coordinator ruling before any r2 output): the bill-payment card shows legacy's one message line as three mutually exclusive texts (bill.error, bill.prompt, bill.success); ERRMSG reads 'bill.error|bill.prompt|bill.success'. Sensitivity (B): ERRMSG <- bill.error only, reported beside r2.",
  "Not shown as separate page elements, so not mapped (missing on the page): ACRCYCR/ACRCYDB (one combined 'Cycle Credit / Debit'), ACSFNAM/ACSMNAM/ACSLNAM (one combined name), ACSADL1/ACSADL2/ACSCITY/ACSSTTE/ACSCTRY/ACSZIPC (one combined address), ACSPHN1/ACSPHN2 (one combined phones), ACSEFTC/ACSPFLG (one combined 'EFT Account / Primary Holder'), ACSGOVT (not on the page), INFOMSG (no info line), OPTN011 (option 11 is hidden while the pending-authorization toggle is false).",
  "OPTN001-OPTN010: the labels of the page's option buttons.",
  "ENTER on the account view maps to Search; the page hides Search once an account is shown (the browser subset checks the page).",
  "Stores: the build's five stores keep the CONTRACT-UI field names and types (data_types.txt): identity field map. The build has no loader workflows (its zz_test_seed workflow loads its own test rows): operator loaders via make-loader.",
  "Not reachable (no button): PF5 everywhere; PF4 except on bill payment."
 ],
